# Line endings are the repository's, not the checkout machine's.
#
# This project is developed on macOS and built in CI on macOS and Windows, so the
# one thing that must not vary is what lands in a blob. Everything text is stored
# and checked out LF; a Windows editor that saves CRLF is normalized on the way in
# rather than showing up as a whole-file diff in someone else's `git status`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, listed because `text=auto` guesses and a wrong guess here is
# silent: a mangled icon or DMG layout still builds, it just looks broken.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary

# No extension to guess from, and it is a Finder layout blob — corrupting it
# breaks the DMG's window arrangement without failing the build.
crates/kindlefill-app/dmg/DS_Store binary
